            <li>Attempt to decompile or reverse engineer any software contained on VishLink.</li>
            <li>Remove any copyright or other proprietary notations from our materials.</li>
            <li>Use the platform to distribute spam or malicious content.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-mono">03</span>
            User-Generated Content
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            You are solely responsible for the content you include in your VishLinks, including images, text, and names. VishLink does not claim ownership of your content; however, by using our service, you grant us a non-exclusive, limited license to host and display your content solely for the purpose of providing and serving your links.<br>
            Free and Paid temporary links generated on VishLink may expire after up to 10 days. VishLink is not responsible for any loss of data, access, or availability resulting from the expiration of those links. <br>
            We reserve the right to remove or disable access to any content that violates our community standards, applicable laws, or legal requirements, without prior notice. <br>
            If you require a truly permanent link, please use the “Permanent Link” button, fill out the form that opens, and pay the amount specified.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-mono">04</span>
            Limitations of Liability
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            In no event shall VishLink be liable for any damages (including, without limitation, damages for loss of
            data or profit, or due to business interruption) arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on
            our platform.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-mono">05</span>
            Privacy Policy
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Your privacy is important to us. Please review our Privacy Policy to understand how we collect, use, and
            protect your personal information when you use our digital celebration platform.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-mono">06</span>
            Service Modifications
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            VishLink reserves the right to revise these terms of service at any time without notice. By using this
            website, you are agreeing to be bound by the then-current version of these terms.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- Decorative blur -->
      <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-64 h-64 bg-indigo-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none">
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Action -->
    <div class="mt-16 text-center">
      <p class="text-slate-500 mb-8 italic">If you have any questions regarding these terms, please <a class="text-emerald-400" href="/contact">contact</a> us.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/"
          class="px-8 py-3 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold rounded-2xl transition shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20">Back
          to Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="text-center pb-12 text-slate-600 text-sm">
    <p>&copy; 2026 VishLink. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>

</html>
